    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="toc">

                <pb facs="0009" n="V" xml:id="pgV"/>

                <head>Contents</head>
                <list type="toc">
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pgIII">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Preface</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg1">General wartime relations between the United States and
                            China, with emphasis on China’s military position and United States
                            efforts to give mílitary assistance to China</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg191">Political conditions in China; Sino-Soviet relations;
                            attitude of the United States toward threatened Kuomintang-Communist
                            conflict</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg268">Negotiations for relinquishment by the United States of
                            extraterritorial rights in China</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>Financial relations between the United States and China: <list>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg419">I. Discussions concerning United States
                                    $500,000,000 credit to China; negotiations in regard to
                                    Financial Agreement signed at Washington, March 21, 1942</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg495">II. Use of Stabilization Fund, exchange rates,
                                    implementation of U. S. credit to China, inflation problem in
                                    China, monopolies, etc.</ref>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg566">Lend-Lease Agreement between the United States and
                            China, signed June 2, 1942</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg573">Aid to China under the Lend-Lease program</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg591">Efforts to establish a supply route to China via Iran,
                            the Soviet Union, and Sinkiang</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg624">Efforts to establish a supply route to China through
                            Tibet; attitude of the United States toward status of Tibet</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg632">Arrangements to obtain strategic materials for the
                            United States from China</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg673">Support by the Department of State of Chinese requests
                            for planes for internal transport in China</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg680">Interest of the United States in maintenance of
                            administrative integrity of Chinese Maritime Customs</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg683">Opening of new American diplomatic and consular posts
                            in China</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg697">Cultural relations program of the Department of State
                            to provide technical assistance to China and to facilitate greater
                            cultural cooperation between the United States and China</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg728">Unwillingness of the United States to grant Chinese
                            request for the formation of Chinese volunteer corps in Hawaii</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg730">Interest of the United States concerning Chinese
                            postwar planning</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg749">Consideration of proposed entry of Chinese troops into
                            Indochina to combat Japanese forces in that colony</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg761">Exchange of views between Generalissimo Chiang Kai-shek
                            and President Roosevelt regarding situation in India</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg762">Exchange of views between the United States and China
                            regarding the future status of Korea and the question of recognizing a
                            provisional Korean government</ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg765">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Index</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                </list>
